content.thinking:
ClassCastException at line 39: `long caseId = JsonPath.read(...)` — JsonPath returns Integer, auto-unboxing to long fails? Integer → long unboxing works via widening? Actually `long caseId = (Integer)` — assigning Integer to long works (unbox then widen). But JsonPath.read with generic inference returns Object cast to... `com.jayway.jsonpath.JsonPath.<Integer>read(...)` — the cast happens to the inferred type. With target type `long`, T inferred as Long → ClassCastException Integer→Long. Fix: `Number id = JsonPath.read(...); long caseId = id.longValue();` or read as String. Use:

```java
Number idValue = com.jayway.jsonpath.JsonPath.read(..., "$.id");
long caseId = idValue.longValue();
```

